            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="1049" n="1020" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76v33/pg1020"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following changes have been made to the online version of <ref
                        target="frus:frus1969-76v33">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1969–1976, Volume XXXIII,
                        SALT II, 1972–1980</ref>. Please be aware that printed volumes have not been
                    revised. </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#d195">Document 195</ref>. </hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The document was incorrectly dated March 15, 1978. The date has been
                        updated to March 15, 1977, but left where it was placed chronologically in
                        the printed volume.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
